      "evidence_class": "structurally_derived",
      "confidence": "candidate",
      "coverage_note": "A plain handler function, recognised by the *fiber.Ctx in its signature. The HandlerName hub is the key a route registration names its handler by, so this is what makes the route -> handler edge land on a declaration."
